{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/FetishWarningNoAI.png?t=1753651663\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Tsukumogami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inanimate objects that gain consciousness after a long time. It's believed that they can sometimes take human form.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lonely candle suddenly inhabits a spirit: a beautiful and curvaceous woman. Stuck behind a locked door, she must find the key to unlock it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the ability to transform and slow down time, she uses her new body to escape the dangerous dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Layers of Bust creates a zen yet adrenaline-filled experience. RNG is constantly changing patterns and outcomes, so each time you play will be different. Slow down time and stay alive as you collect points and power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/SteamBanner1.png?t=1753651663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge moving pillars in this top-down, never-ending, grid-based movement experience. Watch out for the bottomless pit, collapsing ground, and secret enemies <i>like cute ducks</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things will start to speed up, so sometimes you gotta slow down, literally. Slow down time to survive seemingly impossible circumstances, and grab a variety of power-ups to get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/SteamBanner2.png?t=1753651663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CONTAINS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute, voluptuous girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fun story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large selection of outfits to wear. <i>(And take off.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades,\u00a0Challenges, Achievements and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of areas to play in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/PowerUpBar.png?t=1753651663\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772430?t=1753651663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/852446e97fd64cb4abb6dbeece7375329fe7e44f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753651663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/08133f5babd3e0843852266d5c00826e6f811be1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753651663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/08133f5babd3e0843852266d5c00826e6f811be1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753651663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Erotically voluptuous female nudity and fetishes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/FetishWarningNoAI.png?t=1753651663\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Tsukumogami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inanimate objects that gain consciousness after a l